abstract: >-
  Transit ETA prediction suite: GTFS-Realtime ingestion, feature engineering,
  a multi-family model registry (historical mean, EWMA, polynomial
  regression, XGBoost), and a Prefect-based serving path, built to support a
  cross-agency data-quality-asymmetry study.
